des Parish in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/louisiana/rapides-parish"],["ARC or PLC in Rapides Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/rapides-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 55% of normal in October to November and 43% of normal in November to December. Grid 13349 had its driest year in 1954 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
